sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your App (game code)
    participant GT as Game Thread (engine)
    participant RT as Render Thread (engine)
    participant AT as Audio Thread
    participant GPU as GPU

    Note over App,GPU: BOOT — the only moment the game hands anything over
    App->>GT: Engine::run(config, app)
    GT->>GT: window · GpuContext · Capabilities · World · spawn threads
    GT->>App: app.init(ctx) — spawn entities, load assets (handles back)

    Note over GT,RT: steady state — frame N on the game thread WHILE render draws N-1
    par game thread, frame N
        GT->>GT: INPUT — pump events into Input snapshot
        loop 0..N fixed ticks (accumulator on scaled tim. 0 while paused)
            GT->>App: app.fixed_update(ctx)
            GT->>GT: physics provider steps, sync-back via get_mut
        end
        GT->>App: app.update(ctx, dt)
        App->>GT: mutate World via ctx · send events · ctx.audio.play(...)
        GT->>GT: behaviors (BehaviorHost) + systems by phase
        GT->>GT: LATE — transform propagation, bounds, streaming demand
        GT->>RT: EXTRACT — FramePacket (views, lights, deltas, resource ops), bounded send
        GT->>AT: drain AudioCommands
        GT->>GT: CLEAR change tracker → start frame N+1
    and render thread, frame N-1
        RT->>RT: RECEIVE — drain control channel, recv packet
        RT->>RT: PREPARE — apply deltas to RenderScene, record staged uploads
        RT->>RT: CULL — derive shadow views, per-view frustum+HZB, TLAS pre-cull
        RT->>GPU: RECORD render graph + SUBMIT (queue-depth throttle)
        Note over GPU: Deform → Depth → GBuffer/VolumePass → Shadows →<br/>Froxels → Lighting → RT fx → Sky → Transparency → Post/TAAU
        RT->>GT: FrameFeedback (advisory, readback ring)
        RT->>RT: PRESENT
    and audio thread, continuous
        AT->>AT: mix fixed-size blocks (voices → buses) → cpal device
    end
